{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 🤖 Monitoring AI Agents V2 — Threat Hunting & Telemetry (Microsoft Sentinel)\r\n\r\nUnified visibility over your **agentic AI estate** — Microsoft 365 Copilot, Copilot Studio agents, Azure AI Foundry agents, the OpenAI connector, custom/containerized agents, and APIM AI Gateway traffic — from one workbook. Each tab reads the *real runtime telemetry* those platforms export to the Sentinel workspace and surfaces the same signals the detection packs alert on.\r\n\r\n## What this workbook covers (by tab)\r\n| Tab | Source | Tables & keys |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| 📊 **Overview** | All sources | Cross-source volume, active-source status, activity trend |\r\n| 🟦 **M365 Copilot** | Microsoft Copilot connector | `CopilotActivity` · `RecordType`, `LLMEventData` (Messages[].JailbreakDetected, AccessedResources[].XPIADetected, RagSources) |\r\n| 🟨 **Copilot Studio** | Agent App Insights | `AppEvents` (BotMessageReceived/Send, `Properties.text/conversationId/channelId`) + `AppDependencies` (DependencyType=Connector, `Target`, `Success`, `DurationMs`) |\r\n| 🟪 **Foundry Agents** | Foundry → App Insights | `AppDependencies` spans · `Properties['gen_ai.*']` (agent.name, conversation.id, tool.name/type, usage.*, request.model) + `microsoft.foundry.content_filter.results` |\r\n| 🟩 **OpenAI Connector** | OpenAI CCF | `ASimAgentEventLogs` / `OpenAIChatCompletions` (ModelName, InputTokensUsed, OutputTokensUsed, ToolName, AdditionalFields.input_user) + `OpenAIAuditLogs` |\r\n| 🌐 **APIM AI Gateway** | APIM + agent OTel → Application Insights | APIM: `AppRequests`, `AppDependencies`, `AppExceptions`, `AppTraces`, optional `AppMetrics`; agent OTel: `AppDependencies` spans + protected `AppGenAIContent` |\r\n| 🔬 **Defender XDR & Agents** | Defender Advanced Hunting | `AgentsInfo`, `ExposureGraphNodes/Edges`, `DeviceProcessEvents`, and `CloudAppEvents` — cloud/local inventory, MCP exposure, runtime calls, and blast radius. Evidence-first Purview DLP queries appear in Security & Attack Coverage. |\r\n| 🗄️ **Data Lake** | Agent Observability (lake) | `UnifiedAgentObservability` (AISpanOutput spans, Src/Target agents), `EntraAgentIdentities` / `Blueprints` / `BlueprintPrincipals` / `AgentUsers` — usage-based billing |\r\n\r\n## Operational and persona pages\n| Tab | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| 🧭 **Executive Overview** | 15 unified KPIs, AI Risk Score, platform/business-unit activity, and top identities |\n| 🌐 **APIM AI Gateway** | API traffic, backends, consumers, tokens, agent correlation, full request/response bodies, content-safety blocks, prompt injection, and sensitive-data detections |\n| 🔬 **Defender XDR & Agents** | Defender-native behaviors, cloud/local inventory, owners, MCP servers, VS Code MCP configuration/processes/tool calls, risk events, and exposure blast radius |\n| 📒 **Agent Inventory** | Agent type, authentication, knowledge, tools, MCP, owners, ownerless/inactive state, and growth |\n| 📈 **Usage Analytics** | Requests by day, model, user, and department plus token, latency, and cost averages |\n| ⏱️ **Timeline & Investigation** | Global cross-source chronology plus entity-focused timeline, related alerts, and sign-ins |\n| 🚨 **Security & Attack Coverage** | Severity/evidence/verdict semantics, live monitoring, fired alerts and incidents, Purview DLP correlation, detection-pack status, and the 30-risk attack matrix |\n| 🛡️ **Content Safety** | Cross-platform jailbreak and content-safety evidence for M365 Copilot, Foundry, Copilot Studio, and APIM AI Gateway |\n| 🧠 **Model Observability** | Per-model requests, tokens, latency, estimated cost, and failures |\n| ⚙️ **Agent Operations** | Failures, result codes, success percentage, and exceptions |\n| 📋 **Governance** | Ownerless/weak-auth/external-data/MCP posture and shadow AI |\n| 🎯 **AI Risk Score** | Weighted composite 0-100 and component sub-scores |\n| 📡 **Telemetry Health** | Collection KPIs, complete Application Insights table health, hourly volume, telemetry mix, cost, freshness, and content-recording coverage |\n\n## Filters\r\n**Workspace** (portable) · **Time range** · **Agent / bot / model / actor contains** · **APIM subscription** · **APIM telemetry source** (Application Insights or Log Analytics workspace) · **APIM Application Insights / workspace resource**.\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites (per source — tiles stay empty until met)\r\n- **M365 Copilot** → Microsoft Copilot data connector populating `CopilotActivity`; set the table plan to **Analytics** for rules.\r\n- **Copilot Studio** → agent's **workspace-based** Application Insights pointed at this workspace (Settings → Advanced → Application Insights); enable **Log sensitive properties** for the `Properties.text` (content) tiles.\r\n- **Foundry** → project connected to workspace-based App Insights so spans land in `AppDependencies`; set `AZURE_TRACING_GEN_AI_CONTENT_RECORDING_ENABLED=true` for the text-content tiles (not retroactive).\r\n- **OpenAI** → OpenAI codeless connector + parsers so `ASimAgentEventLogs` / `OpenAIAuditLogs` resolve; callers should set the `user` request param for per-user tiles.\r\n- **APIM AI Gateway** → workspace-based Application Insights logger + API diagnostics, W3C correlation, and optional `llm-emit-token-metric`; instrument agent backends with OpenTelemetry GenAI semantics for agent-aware joins.\r\n\r\nCross-source queries use `union isfuzzy=true`, and source-specific tabs document their prerequisites so missing telemetry is easy to distinguish from a clean result."
      },
      "name": "title"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "p-ws",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Workspace",
            "label": "Workspace",
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": false,
            "quote": "",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "typeSettings": {
              "resourceTypeFilter": {
                "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces": true
              },
              "additionalResourceOptions": [],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 86400000
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "p-advanced-hunting-workspace-id",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "AdvancedHuntingWorkspaceId",
            "label": "Advanced Hunting workspace ID",
            "description": "Derived from the selected Sentinel workspace for Defender Advanced Hunting query items.",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": false,
            "quote": "",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces'\n| where id =~ '{Workspace}'\n| project value = tostring(properties.customerId), label = name, selected = true",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "{Workspace:subscription}"
            ],
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true
          },
          {
            "id": "p-apim-sub",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "APIMSubscription",
            "label": "APIM subscription",
            "type": 6,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": null,
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [],
              "includeAll": false,
              "showDefault": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "p-apim-source",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "APIMTelemetrySource",
            "label": "APIM telemetry source",
            "description": "Choose a Log Analytics workspace or an Application Insights component.",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": false,
            "quote": "",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"applicationInsights\",\"label\":\"Application Insights\",\"selected\":true},{\"value\":\"workspace\",\"label\":\"Log Analytics workspace\"}]",
            "value": "applicationInsights"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-apim-ws",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "APIMWorkspace",
            "label": "APIM telemetry workspace",
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": false,
            "query": "resources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces\"\n| order by name asc\n| project id, name, selected = false, group = resourceGroup",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "{APIMSubscription}"
            ],
            "value": null,
            "typeSettings": {
              "resourceTypeFilter": {
                "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces": true
              },
              "additionalResourceOptions": []
            },
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-apim-appinsights",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "APIMApplicationInsights",
            "label": "APIM Application Insights",
            "description": "Application Insights component that receives APIM requests/customDimensions telemetry.",
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": false,
            "query": "resources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.insights/components\"\n| order by name asc\n| project id, name, selected = false, group = resourceGroup",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "{APIMSubscription}"
            ],
            "value": null,
            "typeSettings": {
              "resourceTypeFilter": {
                "microsoft.insights/components": true
              },
              "additionalResourceOptions": []
            },
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-timerange",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Time range",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 14400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 43200000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 172800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 604800000
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "p-agentsearch",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "AgentSearch",
            "label": "Agent / bot / model / actor contains",
            "description": "Free-text filter applied to the per-source grids (agent name, bot UserId, model, actor). Empty = show all.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": ""
          },
          {
            "id": "p-dept",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DepartmentSearch",
            "label": "Department contains",
            "description": "Filters usage / business-unit tiles by resolved department (IdentityInfo join on actor UPN).",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": ""
          },
          {
            "id": "p-pin",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "PriceInput",
            "label": "Price / 1K input tokens (USD)",
            "description": "Used for token cost estimation tiles.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "0.005"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-pout",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "PriceOutput",
            "label": "Price / 1K output tokens (USD)",
            "description": "Used for token cost estimation tiles.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "0.015"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-tab",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "selectedTab",
            "label": "selectedTab",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "exec",
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "Pick a **Workspace** and **Time range** above, then use the tabs. Type in **Agent / bot / model / actor contains** to focus the grids on one agent. Content-based tiles (prompt/response text) require the per-source content-recording setting noted in the Prerequisites above."
      },
      "name": "FiltersHelp"
    },
