          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🛡️ AI Gateway threat protection & detections\n\nLayer **runtime keys or Entra token validation**, **managed identity to backends**, **Prompt Shields/content safety**, **IP filtering**, and **request/token limits**. The panels below treat HTTP status codes as triage signals, not proof of one policy: depending on APIM tier and policy, `400`/`403` can represent content, validation, IP, quota, or authorization blocks; `429` represents request/token throttling. Content-safety attribution requires sanitized `AppTraces` metadata.",
              "style": "warning"
            },
            "name": "apim-security-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "union isfuzzy=true\n(AppRequests | where SDKVersion startswith \"apim:\" and ResultCode == \"400\" | summarize Value = todouble(count()) | extend Metric = \"Validation / safety 400\", Order = 1),\n(AppRequests | where SDKVersion startswith \"apim:\" and ResultCode == \"401\" | summarize Value = todouble(count()) | extend Metric = \"Authentication 401\", Order = 2),\n(AppRequests | where SDKVersion startswith \"apim:\" and ResultCode == \"403\" | summarize Value = todouble(count()) | extend Metric = \"Policy / authorization 403\", Order = 3),\n(AppRequests | where SDKVersion startswith \"apim:\" and ResultCode == \"404\" | summarize Value = todouble(count()) | extend Metric = \"Reconnaissance 404\", Order = 4),\n(AppRequests | where SDKVersion startswith \"apim:\" and ResultCode == \"429\" | summarize Value = todouble(count()) | extend Metric = \"Rate / token limit 429\", Order = 5),\n(AppRequests | where SDKVersion startswith \"apim:\" and toint(ResultCode) >= 500 | summarize Value = todouble(count()) | extend Metric = \"Gateway / backend 5xx\", Order = 6)\n| project Order, Metric, Value\n| sort by Order asc",
              "size": 3,
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "title": "Gateway security signals",
              "tileSettings": {
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "blue"
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true,
