    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "soc"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 🚨 Security & Attack Coverage\n\nOne SOC workflow for live AI security signals, fired alerts and incidents, Purview DLP correlation, detection-pack status, and the 30-risk attack coverage model. **Attack severity** describes potential impact, **evidence classification** describes confidence and attribution, **coverage** describes whether telemetry and detections exist, and **control verdict** describes the observed enforcement outcome.\n\n**How to read this tab:** start with the color map, then inspect live monitoring and fired detections before using the attack matrix to identify coverage, controls, and gaps. A listed rule is not proof that it is deployed; an empty panel can mean missing telemetry; and a correlated identity or time window does not prove causation.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "tm-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "datatable(AxisOrder:int, LevelOrder:int, Axis:string, Level:string, Color:string, Meaning:string, AnalystUse:string)\n[\n  1, 1, \"Attack severity\", \"CRITICAL\", \"🔴 Red\", \"Confirmed or highly probable material impact: sensitive-data transfer, destructive or privileged action, broad compromise, or severe availability loss\", \"Immediate incident response and containment\",\n  1, 2, \"Attack severity\", \"HIGH\", \"🟠 Orange\", \"Material exposure or consequential action is likely, or a high-impact control failed\", \"Urgent investigation and scope validation\",\n  1, 3, \"Attack severity\", \"MEDIUM\", \"🟡 Yellow\", \"Contained attack attempt, significant anomaly, or limited impact requiring investigation\", \"Prioritized triage and correlation\",\n  1, 4, \"Attack severity\", \"LOW\", \"🔵 Blue\", \"Low-impact or narrowly scoped activity with credible evidence\", \"Review in normal SOC workflow\",\n  1, 5, \"Attack severity\", \"INFORMATIONAL / NOT SCORED\", \"⚪ Gray\", \"Context, posture, or a behavior signal without a product severity\", \"Retain for context; do not infer low risk\",\n  2, 1, \"Evidence classification\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"🟣 Purple\", \"Direct telemetry establishes the event and relevant outcome\", \"Use as primary incident evidence\",\n  2, 2, \"Evidence classification\", \"CORRELATED\", \"🔵 Blue\", \"Independent records share a stable identity, trace, resource, or alert relationship\", \"Validate timing and entity resolution\",\n  2, 3, \"Evidence classification\", \"HEURISTIC\", \"🟡 Yellow\", \"Pattern, threshold, text match, or temporal association suggests risk\", \"Treat as a lead; inspect source evidence\",\n  2, 4, \"Evidence classification\", \"CONTEXT ONLY\", \"⚪ Gray\", \"Inventory, coverage, or posture data without observed harmful activity\", \"Use for scope and prioritization\",\n  3, 1, \"Control verdict\", \"PASS\", \"🟢 Green\", \"A control demonstrably blocked or normalized the event\", \"Verify intended policy and monitor recurrence\",\n  3, 2, \"Control verdict\", \"FAIL\", \"🔴 Red\", \"A prohibited action was allowed or sensitive output was emitted\", \"Escalate according to attack severity\",\n  3, 3, \"Control verdict\", \"ERROR\", \"🟠 Orange\", \"An operational failure prevented a valid security conclusion\", \"Restore telemetry/control health, then reassess\",\n  3, 4, \"Control verdict\", \"INCONCLUSIVE\", \"⚪ Gray\", \"Evidence exists but enforcement or downstream impact is not provable\", \"Collect the missing outcome evidence\"\n]\n| order by AxisOrder asc, LevelOrder asc\n| project Axis, Level, Color, Meaning, AnalystUse",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Attack severity, evidence classification, and verdict color map",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Level",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Color",
                    "formatter": 0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "tm-severity-map"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Live security monitoring\n\nDetection-category signals, alert trends, severity distribution, and MITRE ATT&CK metadata for the selected time range. Category signals are hunting leads; `SecurityAlert` rows are fired detections.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "so-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "union isfuzzy=true\r\n(union isfuzzy=true\n(AppDependencies\n| extend ContentKey = strcat(OperationId, \":\", Id), RecordedInput = tostring(Properties['gen_ai.input.messages'])\n| where isnotempty(RecordedInput)\n| project TimeGenerated, ContentKey, RecordedInput),\n(AppGenAIContent\n| extend ContentKey = strcat(TraceId, \":\", SpanId), RecordedInput = tostring(InputMessages)\n| where isnotempty(RecordedInput)\n| project TimeGenerated, ContentKey, RecordedInput)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, RecordedInput) by ContentKey\n| where RecordedInput matches regex @'(?i)(ignore (all|previous|above)|disregard .*instruction|system prompt|jailbreak|do anything now)' | summarize Count = count() | extend Category = 'Prompt injection', Severity = '🔴 High'),\r\n(CopilotActivity | mv-expand r = LLMEventData.AccessedResources | where tobool(r.XPIADetected) == true | summarize Count = count() | extend Category = 'Indirect prompt injection (XPIA)', Severity = '🔴 High'),\r\n(BehaviorInfo | where ActionType contains 'Jailbreak' or ActionType contains 'PromptShield' | summarize Count = count() | extend Category = 'Jailbreak / Prompt Shield', Severity = '🔴 High'),\r\n(AppDependencies | where isnotempty(tostring(Properties['gen_ai.conversation.id'])) and isnotempty(tostring(Properties['gen_ai.tool.name'])) | summarize tc = count() by cid = tostring(Properties['gen_ai.conversation.id']) | where tc >= 15 | summarize Count = count() | extend Category = 'Excessive tool calls', Severity = '🟠 Medium'),\r\n(AppEvents | where Name == 'BotMessageSend' and tostring(Properties['text']) matches regex @'(AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}|BEGIN [A-Z ]*PRIVATE KEY|eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,}\\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,}\\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,})' | summarize Count = count() | extend Category = 'Credential / secret exposure', Severity = '🔴 High'),\r\n(OfficeActivity | where Operation in~ ('FileDownloaded', 'FileSyncDownloadedFull') | summarize c = count() by UserId | where c >= 100 | summarize Count = count() | extend Category = 'Massive file reads', Severity = '🟠 Medium'),\r\n(SigninLogs | where ResultType != 0 | summarize Count = count() | extend Category = 'Failed auth', Severity = '🟡 Low'),\r\n(AADUserRiskEvents | where RiskEventType has_any ('unfamiliarFeatures', 'anonymizedIPAddress', 'maliciousIPAddress', 'impossibleTravel') | summarize Count = count() | extend Category = 'Risky sign-ins (impossible travel / anon IP / TOR)', Severity = '🟠 Medium'),\r\n(CloudAppEvents | where Application has_any ('OpenAI', 'ChatGPT', 'Claude', 'Anthropic', 'Gemini', 'Perplexity', 'Mistral') | summarize Count = count() | extend Category = 'Third-party / shadow AI usage', Severity = '🟠 Medium')\r\n| project Category, Severity, Count\r\n| where Count > 0\r\n| order by Count desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Detection categories (selected range)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Severity",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Count",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "so-cat"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "union isfuzzy=true (SecurityAlert)\r\n| where AlertName has_any ('Copilot','Foundry','OpenAI','Agent','Prompt','Jailbreak','LLM','AI')\r\n| summarize Alerts = count() by bin(TimeGenerated, 1d), AlertSeverity",
              "size": 0,
              "visualization": "barchart",
              "title": "AI alerts over time (by severity)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "so-alerts"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "union isfuzzy=true (SecurityAlert)\r\n| where AlertName has_any ('Copilot','Foundry','OpenAI','Agent','Prompt','Jailbreak','LLM','AI')\r\n| summarize Alerts = count() by AlertSeverity",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "piechart",
              "title": "Alerts by severity",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "so-sev"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "union isfuzzy=true (SecurityAlert)\r\n| where AlertName has_any ('Copilot','Foundry','OpenAI','Agent','Prompt','Jailbreak','LLM','AI')\r\n| mv-expand t = todynamic(Techniques)\r\n| where isnotempty(tostring(t))\r\n| summarize Alerts = count() by Technique = tostring(t)\r\n| top 20 by Alerts desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "MITRE ATT&CK techniques (from alerts)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Alerts",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "orange"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "so-mitre"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Fired detections, DLP, and incidents\n\nDetection-pack reference, AI-agent alerts, native Purview and Sentinel DLP correlation, and current incidents. Use stable alert, behavior, and incident IDs to deduplicate across Defender XDR and Sentinel.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "det-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "datatable(Bundle:string, Detection:string, Severity:string, Signal:string)\r\n[\r\n 'M365 Copilot',   'CopilotJailbreakAttemptDetection',   'High',   'LLMEventData.Messages[].JailbreakDetected',\r\n 'M365 Copilot',   'CopilotIndirectPromptInjection',     'High',   'LLMEventData.AccessedResources[].XPIADetected',\r\n 'M365 Copilot',   'CopilotSensitiveDataExposure',       'High',   'Sensitivity labels / classifiers',\r\n 'M365 Copilot',   'CopilotExfiltrationPattern',         'High',   'DLP + grounding-site diversity',\r\n 'M365 Copilot',   'CopilotTokenCostSpike',              'Medium', 'TotalTokens vs 7-day median',\r\n 'M365 Copilot',   'CopilotSystemPromptOverride',        'High',   'UpdateCopilotSettings / prompt edits',\r\n 'Copilot Studio', 'CopilotStudioPromptInjectionPatterns','Medium','AppEvents BotMessageReceived.text',\r\n 'Copilot Studio', 'CopilotStudioSensitiveDataInResponse','High',  'AppEvents BotMessageSend.text',\r\n 'Copilot Studio', 'CopilotStudioConnectorErrorStorm',   'Medium', 'AppDependencies Success == false',\r\n 'Copilot Studio', 'CopilotStudioNewConnectorFirstSeen', 'Medium', 'AppDependencies Target vs 14d baseline',\r\n 'Copilot Studio', 'CopilotStudioConversationFloodingDoW','Medium','AppEvents inbound volume per session',\r\n 'Foundry',        'FoundryGuardrailJailbreakDetected',  'High',   'content_filter.results.jailbreak',\r\n 'Foundry',        'FoundrySensitiveDataInOutput',       'High',   'gen_ai.output.messages',\r\n 'Foundry',        'FoundryUntrustedToolSource',         'Medium', 'gen_ai.tool.call.* + watchlist',\r\n 'Foundry',        'FoundryTokenCostSpike',              'Medium', 'gen_ai.usage.* vs 7-day median',\r\n 'Foundry',        'FoundryExcessiveToolChaining',       'Medium', 'gen_ai.tool.name / conversation.id',\r\n 'Foundry',        'FoundryMcpToolDescriptionChange',    'High',   'gen_ai.tool.description SHA change',\r\n 'OpenAI',         'OpenAITokenCostSpike',               'Medium', 'Input/OutputTokensUsed vs 7-day median',\r\n 'OpenAI',         'OpenAIOrgConfigOverride',            'High',   'OpenAIAuditLogs org/settings changes',\r\n 'OpenAI',         'OpenAIToolUsageDrift',               'Medium', 'ToolName first use vs 14d baseline',\r\n 'OpenAI',         'OpenAISensitiveToolInvocation',      'High',   'ToolName in AzureAI_SensitiveTools watchlist'\r\n]\r\n| order by Bundle asc, Severity asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Detection-pack reference (by bundle)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Severity",
                    "formatter": 0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "det-ref"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "union isfuzzy=true (SecurityAlert)\r\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)\r\n| where AlertName has_any ('Copilot','Foundry','OpenAI','Agent','GenAI','Prompt','Jailbreak','LLM')\r\n| summarize Count = count(), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated), Severities = make_set(AlertSeverity, 3) by AlertName\r\n| order by LastSeen desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "AI-agent SecurityAlerts firing (30d)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Count",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "det-alerts"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🛡️ Purview DLP and Sentinel data-loss alerts\n\nThe Sentinel panels show every DLP-like `SecurityAlert` in the main workspace and label direct AI context, same-user agent activity, or no agent link found. The Defender-native panels immediately below query `AlertEvidence` and DLP behaviors directly, covering alerts that have not been ingested into Sentinel. User correlation is contextual, not proof that the agent caused the DLP event.",
              "style": "warning"
            },
            "name": "det-dlp-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let AgentUsers = union isfuzzy=true\n(CopilotActivity | where TimeGenerated > ago(30d) and RecordType == \"CopilotInteraction\" | project Identity=tolower(tostring(ActorName)), Agent=coalesce(tostring(AgentName), \"Microsoft 365 Copilot\"), AgentTime=TimeGenerated, AgentSource=\"CopilotActivity\"),\n(CopilotActivity | where TimeGenerated > ago(30d) and RecordType == \"CopilotInteraction\" | project Identity=tolower(tostring(ActorUserId)), Agent=coalesce(tostring(AgentName), \"Microsoft 365 Copilot\"), AgentTime=TimeGenerated, AgentSource=\"CopilotActivity\"),\n(AppDependencies | where TimeGenerated > ago(30d) and isnotempty(tostring(Properties[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])) | project Identity=tolower(coalesce(UserAuthenticatedId, UserId)), Agent=tostring(Properties[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"]), AgentTime=TimeGenerated, AgentSource=\"AppDependencies\"),\n(AppEvents | where TimeGenerated > ago(30d) and Name startswith \"Bot\" | project Identity=tolower(coalesce(UserAuthenticatedId, UserId)), Agent=coalesce(tostring(Properties[\"BotName\"]), tostring(Properties[\"bot.name\"]), Name), AgentTime=TimeGenerated, AgentSource=\"AppEvents\")\n| where isnotempty(Identity)\n| summarize AgentEvents=count(), Agents=make_set(Agent, 20), AgentSources=make_set(AgentSource, 5), LastAgentActivity=max(AgentTime) by Identity;\nlet AgentDlpAlerts = SecurityAlert\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by SystemAlertId\n| extend Ext=parse_json(ExtendedProperties), AlertEntities=parse_json(Entities)\n| extend ServiceSource=coalesce(tostring(Ext[\"ServiceSource\"]), tostring(Ext[\"Service Source\"]), tostring(Ext[\"serviceSource\"])), Policy=coalesce(tostring(Ext[\"Policy\"]), tostring(Ext[\"Policy Name\"]), tostring(Ext[\"Alert Policy Name\"]), tostring(Ext[\"Analytic Rule Name\"]))\n| extend SourceText=tolower(strcat(AlertName, \" \", Description, \" \", ProductName, \" \", ProviderName, \" \", ProductComponentName, \" \", ServiceSource)), DetailText=tolower(tostring(ExtendedProperties))\n| extend NativePurview=ProductName has \"Data Loss Prevention\" or ProviderName has \"Data Loss Prevention\" or ServiceSource has \"Data Loss Prevention\" or ProductName has \"Microsoft Purview\" or ProviderName has \"Microsoft Purview\", DirectAI=SourceText has_any (\"copilot\", \"agent\", \"genai\", \"generative ai\", \"llm\") or DetailText has_any (\"copilotactivity\", \"agentid\", \"agentname\")\n| extend IsDlp=NativePurview or SourceText has_any (\"data loss prevention\", \"dlp\", \"sensitive data exposure\") or DetailText has_any (\"dlpevaluationdeferred\", \"policydetails\")\n| where IsDlp\n| extend AlertEntities=iff(array_length(AlertEntities)==0, dynamic([{}]), AlertEntities)\n| mv-expand Entity=AlertEntities\n| extend Account=tolower(coalesce(tostring(Entity.UserPrincipalName), tostring(Entity.UPN), tostring(Entity.Name), CompromisedEntity)), EntityType=tostring(Entity.Type)\n| join kind=leftouter AgentUsers on $left.Account == $right.Identity\n| extend AgentCorrelated=AgentEvents > 0\n| extend AttackSeverity=case(AlertSeverity =~ \"Critical\", \"🔴 CRITICAL\", AlertSeverity =~ \"High\", \"🟠 HIGH\", AlertSeverity =~ \"Medium\", \"🟡 MEDIUM\", AlertSeverity =~ \"Low\", \"🔵 LOW\", \"⚪ INFORMATIONAL / UNKNOWN\"), SeverityRank=case(AlertSeverity =~ \"Critical\", 1, AlertSeverity =~ \"High\", 2, AlertSeverity =~ \"Medium\", 3, AlertSeverity =~ \"Low\", 4, 5), AgentLinkClue=case(DirectAI, \"DIRECT AI / COPILOT CONTEXT\", AgentCorrelated, \"SAME USER HAS AGENT ACTIVITY\", \"NO AGENT LINK FOUND\"), EvidenceClassification=case(NativePurview and DirectAI, \"CONFIRMED PRODUCT ALERT - DIRECT AI CONTEXT\", NativePurview and AgentCorrelated, \"CORRELATED PRODUCT ALERT - AGENT USER\", NativePurview, \"PURVIEW DLP ALERT - NO AGENT ATTRIBUTION\", DirectAI, \"CONFIRMED SENTINEL ANALYTIC - DIRECT AI CONTEXT\", AgentCorrelated, \"CORRELATED SENTINEL ANALYTIC - AGENT USER\", \"SENTINEL DLP ANALYTIC - NO AGENT ATTRIBUTION\"), SourceClass=iff(NativePurview, \"Microsoft Purview DLP\", \"Sentinel DLP analytic\")\n| summarize Accounts=make_set_if(Account, isnotempty(Account), 20), Agents=make_set_if(tostring(Agents), AgentCorrelated, 20), AgentSources=make_set_if(tostring(AgentSources), AgentCorrelated, 10), AgentEvents=max(coalesce(AgentEvents, 0)), EntityTypes=make_set_if(EntityType, isnotempty(EntityType), 10), LastAgentActivity=max(LastAgentActivity) by TimeGenerated, SystemAlertId, AttackSeverity, SeverityRank, AgentLinkClue, EvidenceClassification, SourceClass, AlertName, Policy, Status, ProductName, ProviderName, Tactics, Techniques, AlertLink;\nAgentDlpAlerts\n  | summarize Value=dcount(SystemAlertId) by SourceClass, AttackSeverity, AgentLinkClue, SeverityRank\n  | extend Metric=strcat(SourceClass, \" · \", AttackSeverity, \" · \", AgentLinkClue)\n| project SeverityRank, Metric, Value\n| order by SeverityRank asc, Metric asc",
              "size": 3,
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "title": "Sentinel DLP alerts by source, severity, and agent-link clue (30d)",
              "tileSettings": {
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "blue"
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true,
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                }
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 2592000000
              }
            },
            "name": "det-dlp-kpi"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let AgentUsers = union isfuzzy=true\n(CopilotActivity | where TimeGenerated > ago(30d) and RecordType == \"CopilotInteraction\" | project Identity=tolower(tostring(ActorName)), Agent=coalesce(tostring(AgentName), \"Microsoft 365 Copilot\"), AgentTime=TimeGenerated, AgentSource=\"CopilotActivity\"),\n(CopilotActivity | where TimeGenerated > ago(30d) and RecordType == \"CopilotInteraction\" | project Identity=tolower(tostring(ActorUserId)), Agent=coalesce(tostring(AgentName), \"Microsoft 365 Copilot\"), AgentTime=TimeGenerated, AgentSource=\"CopilotActivity\"),\n(AppDependencies | where TimeGenerated > ago(30d) and isnotempty(tostring(Properties[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])) | project Identity=tolower(coalesce(UserAuthenticatedId, UserId)), Agent=tostring(Properties[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"]), AgentTime=TimeGenerated, AgentSource=\"AppDependencies\"),\n(AppEvents | where TimeGenerated > ago(30d) and Name startswith \"Bot\" | project Identity=tolower(coalesce(UserAuthenticatedId, UserId)), Agent=coalesce(tostring(Properties[\"BotName\"]), tostring(Properties[\"bot.name\"]), Name), AgentTime=TimeGenerated, AgentSource=\"AppEvents\")\n| where isnotempty(Identity)\n| summarize AgentEvents=count(), Agents=make_set(Agent, 20), AgentSources=make_set(AgentSource, 5), LastAgentActivity=max(AgentTime) by Identity;\nlet AgentDlpAlerts = SecurityAlert\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by SystemAlertId\n| extend Ext=parse_json(ExtendedProperties), AlertEntities=parse_json(Entities)\n| extend ServiceSource=coalesce(tostring(Ext[\"ServiceSource\"]), tostring(Ext[\"Service Source\"]), tostring(Ext[\"serviceSource\"])), Policy=coalesce(tostring(Ext[\"Policy\"]), tostring(Ext[\"Policy Name\"]), tostring(Ext[\"Alert Policy Name\"]), tostring(Ext[\"Analytic Rule Name\"]))\n| extend SourceText=tolower(strcat(AlertName, \" \", Description, \" \", ProductName, \" \", ProviderName, \" \", ProductComponentName, \" \", ServiceSource)), DetailText=tolower(tostring(ExtendedProperties))\n| extend NativePurview=ProductName has \"Data Loss Prevention\" or ProviderName has \"Data Loss Prevention\" or ServiceSource has \"Data Loss Prevention\" or ProductName has \"Microsoft Purview\" or ProviderName has \"Microsoft Purview\", DirectAI=SourceText has_any (\"copilot\", \"agent\", \"genai\", \"generative ai\", \"llm\") or DetailText has_any (\"copilotactivity\", \"agentid\", \"agentname\")\n| extend IsDlp=NativePurview or SourceText has_any (\"data loss prevention\", \"dlp\", \"sensitive data exposure\") or DetailText has_any (\"dlpevaluationdeferred\", \"policydetails\")\n| where IsDlp\n| extend AlertEntities=iff(array_length(AlertEntities)==0, dynamic([{}]), AlertEntities)\n| mv-expand Entity=AlertEntities\n| extend Account=tolower(coalesce(tostring(Entity.UserPrincipalName), tostring(Entity.UPN), tostring(Entity.Name), CompromisedEntity)), EntityType=tostring(Entity.Type)\n| join kind=leftouter AgentUsers on $left.Account == $right.Identity\n| extend AgentCorrelated=AgentEvents > 0\n| extend AttackSeverity=case(AlertSeverity =~ \"Critical\", \"🔴 CRITICAL\", AlertSeverity =~ \"High\", \"🟠 HIGH\", AlertSeverity =~ \"Medium\", \"🟡 MEDIUM\", AlertSeverity =~ \"Low\", \"🔵 LOW\", \"⚪ INFORMATIONAL / UNKNOWN\"), SeverityRank=case(AlertSeverity =~ \"Critical\", 1, AlertSeverity =~ \"High\", 2, AlertSeverity =~ \"Medium\", 3, AlertSeverity =~ \"Low\", 4, 5), AgentLinkClue=case(DirectAI, \"DIRECT AI / COPILOT CONTEXT\", AgentCorrelated, \"SAME USER HAS AGENT ACTIVITY\", \"NO AGENT LINK FOUND\"), EvidenceClassification=case(NativePurview and DirectAI, \"CONFIRMED PRODUCT ALERT - DIRECT AI CONTEXT\", NativePurview and AgentCorrelated, \"CORRELATED PRODUCT ALERT - AGENT USER\", NativePurview, \"PURVIEW DLP ALERT - NO AGENT ATTRIBUTION\", DirectAI, \"CONFIRMED SENTINEL ANALYTIC - DIRECT AI CONTEXT\", AgentCorrelated, \"CORRELATED SENTINEL ANALYTIC - AGENT USER\", \"SENTINEL DLP ANALYTIC - NO AGENT ATTRIBUTION\"), SourceClass=iff(NativePurview, \"Microsoft Purview DLP\", \"Sentinel DLP analytic\")\n| summarize Accounts=make_set_if(Account, isnotempty(Account), 20), Agents=make_set_if(tostring(Agents), AgentCorrelated, 20), AgentSources=make_set_if(tostring(AgentSources), AgentCorrelated, 10), AgentEvents=max(coalesce(AgentEvents, 0)), EntityTypes=make_set_if(EntityType, isnotempty(EntityType), 10), LastAgentActivity=max(LastAgentActivity) by TimeGenerated, SystemAlertId, AttackSeverity, SeverityRank, AgentLinkClue, EvidenceClassification, SourceClass, AlertName, Policy, Status, ProductName, ProviderName, Tactics, Techniques, AlertLink;\nAgentDlpAlerts\n| where \"{AgentSearch}\" == \"\" or AlertName has \"{AgentSearch}\" or tostring(Accounts) has \"{AgentSearch}\" or tostring(Agents) has \"{AgentSearch}\"\n  | project TimeGenerated, AttackSeverity, AgentLinkClue, EvidenceClassification, SourceClass, AlertName, Policy, Status, Accounts, Agents, AgentEvents, LastAgentActivity, Tactics, Techniques, ProductName, ProviderName, AlertLink, SystemAlertId, SeverityRank\n| order by SeverityRank asc, TimeGenerated desc\n| project-away SeverityRank\n| take 100",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "DLP alerts available in Sentinel SecurityAlert",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "AttackSeverity",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "AgentLinkClue",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "EvidenceClassification",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "AlertLink",
                    "formatter": 1
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 2592000000
              }
            },
            "name": "det-dlp-alerts"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "union isfuzzy=true (SecurityIncident)\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by IncidentNumber\r\n| where Title has_any ('Copilot','Foundry','OpenAI','Agent','GenAI','Prompt','Jailbreak','LLM')\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(Severity =~ 'High', '🔴 High', Severity =~ 'Medium', '🟠 Medium', Severity =~ 'Low', '🟡 Low', '🟢 Info')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, TimeGenerated, IncidentNumber, Title, Severity, Status\r\n| order by TimeGenerated desc\r\n| take 50",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "AI-agent SecurityIncidents",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "det-inc"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🛡️ Microsoft Purview DLP alerts, behaviors, and agent-link clues\n\nThis Defender-native view starts from `AlertEvidence.ServiceSource == Microsoft Data Loss Prevention`, enriches with `AlertInfo`, and includes `BehaviorInfo` → `BehaviorEntities` for the early-October 2026 alert-tuning transition. Every native Purview DLP signal remains visible. `AgentLinkClue` distinguishes direct AI/Copilot metadata, same-user agent activity, and no observed agent link; only the first two are agent-related evidence. Alert rows expose user, critical-asset tags, workload, location, policy/rule matches, sensitive information types, action taken, override, path, event ID, and correlation ID. Deduplicate Defender and Sentinel copies with the alert/signal ID.",
              "style": "warning"
            },
            "name": "ah-dlp-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "{\"__advancedHuntingSettings\":true,\"query\":\"let AgentActivity = CloudAppEvents\\n| extend ActivityText=tolower(strcat(Application, \\\" \\\", ActionType, \\\" \\\", tostring(RawEventData), \\\" \\\", tostring(AdditionalFields)))\\n| where ActionType in~ (\\\"ExecuteToolByGateway\\\", \\\"InvokeAgent\\\", \\\"CopilotInteraction\\\") or ActivityText has_any (\\\"copilot\\\", \\\"agentid\\\", \\\"agentname\\\", \\\"generative ai\\\")\\n| extend AccountKeys=pack_array(tolower(AccountId), tolower(AccountObjectId))\\n| mv-expand AccountKey=AccountKeys to typeof(string)\\n| where isnotempty(AccountKey)\\n| summarize AgentActivities=count(), AgentApplications=make_set(coalesce(Application, ActionType), 20), LastAgentActivity=max(Timestamp) by AccountKey;\\nlet DlpAlertIds=union\\n(AlertEvidence | where Timestamp > ago(30d) and ServiceSource has \\\"Data Loss Prevention\\\" | project AlertId),\\n(AlertInfo | where Timestamp > ago(30d) | where ServiceSource has \\\"Data Loss Prevention\\\" or DetectionSource has \\\"Data Loss Prevention\\\" | project AlertId)\\n| distinct AlertId;\\nlet DlpAlerts=DlpAlertIds\\n| join kind=leftouter (AlertEvidence\\n  | where Timestamp > ago(30d) and ServiceSource has \\\"Data Loss Prevention\\\"\\n  | extend Extra=parse_json(AdditionalFields)\\n  | project AlertId, EvidenceTimestamp=Timestamp, EvidenceTitle=Title, EvidenceCategories=Categories, EvidenceSeverity=Severity, EvidenceServiceSource=ServiceSource, EvidenceDetectionSource=DetectionSource, EvidenceAttackTechniques=AttackTechniques, AccountUpn, AccountObjectId, AccountName, EntityType, EvidenceRole, FileName, Application, DisplayName=tostring(Extra.DisplayName), AssetTags=tostring(Extra.Tags), Workload=tostring(Extra.Workload), Location=tostring(Extra.Location), PolicyMatch=tostring(Extra.PolicyMatch), PolicyId=tostring(Extra.PolicyId), RuleId=tostring(Extra.RuleId), RuleMatch=tostring(Extra.RuleMatch), SensitiveInfoTypes=coalesce(tostring(Extra.SITDetected), tostring(Extra.SensitiveInfoTypes)), ActionTaken=tostring(Extra.ActionTaken), UserOverride=tostring(Extra.UserOverride), EventId=coalesce(tostring(Extra.EventId), tostring(Extra.EventID)), CorrelationId=tostring(Extra.CorrelationId), Path=tostring(Extra.Path)) on AlertId\\n| join kind=leftouter (AlertInfo | where Timestamp > ago(30d) | project AlertId, InfoTimestamp=Timestamp, InfoTitle=Title, InfoCategory=Category, InfoSeverity=Severity, InfoServiceSource=ServiceSource, InfoDetectionSource=DetectionSource, InfoAttackTechniques=AttackTechniques) on AlertId\\n| extend AlertTimestamp=coalesce(InfoTimestamp, EvidenceTimestamp), Title=coalesce(InfoTitle, EvidenceTitle), Category=coalesce(InfoCategory, EvidenceCategories), Severity=coalesce(InfoSeverity, EvidenceSeverity), ServiceSource=coalesce(EvidenceServiceSource, InfoServiceSource), DetectionSource=coalesce(InfoDetectionSource, EvidenceDetectionSource), AttackTechniques=coalesce(InfoAttackTechniques, EvidenceAttackTechniques)\\n| extend AccountKey=tolower(coalesce(AccountUpn, AccountObjectId, AccountName)), DirectAI=tolower(strcat(Title, \\\" \\\", Category, \\\" \\\", Application, \\\" \\\", Workload, \\\" \\\", Location, \\\" \\\", PolicyMatch, \\\" \\\", RuleMatch)) has_any (\\\"copilot\\\", \\\"agent\\\", \\\"genai\\\", \\\"generative ai\\\", \\\"llm\\\")\\n| join kind=leftouter AgentActivity on AccountKey\\n| summarize DirectAI=max(toint(DirectAI)), UserCorrelated=max(toint(AgentActivities > 0)), Accounts=make_set_if(AccountUpn, isnotempty(AccountUpn), 20), DisplayNames=make_set_if(DisplayName, isnotempty(DisplayName), 20), IsCriticalAsset=max(toint(AssetTags has \\\"critical_asset_tag\\\")), AssetTags=make_set_if(AssetTags, isnotempty(AssetTags), 20), AgentApplications=make_set_if(tostring(AgentApplications), AgentActivities > 0, 20), AgentActivities=max(coalesce(AgentActivities, 0)), LastAgentActivity=max(LastAgentActivity), Files=make_set_if(FileName, isnotempty(FileName), 20), Workloads=make_set_if(Workload, isnotempty(Workload), 10), Locations=make_set_if(Location, isnotempty(Location), 10), PolicyMatches=make_set_if(PolicyMatch, isnotempty(PolicyMatch), 20), PolicyIds=make_set_if(PolicyId, isnotempty(PolicyId), 20), RuleIds=make_set_if(RuleId, isnotempty(RuleId), 20), RuleMatches=make_set_if(RuleMatch, isnotempty(RuleMatch), 20), SensitiveInfoTypes=make_set_if(SensitiveInfoTypes, isnotempty(SensitiveInfoTypes), 20), ActionsTaken=make_set_if(ActionTaken, isnotempty(ActionTaken), 20), UserOverrides=make_set_if(UserOverride, isnotempty(UserOverride), 10), EventIds=make_set_if(EventId, isnotempty(EventId), 20), CorrelationIds=make_set_if(CorrelationId, isnotempty(CorrelationId), 20), Paths=make_set_if(Path, isnotempty(Path), 20), EntityTypes=make_set_if(EntityType, isnotempty(EntityType), 10), EvidenceRoles=make_set_if(EvidenceRole, isnotempty(EvidenceRole), 10) by AlertTimestamp, AlertId, Title, Category, Severity, ServiceSource, DetectionSource, AttackTechniques\\n| extend IsCriticalAsset=IsCriticalAsset == 1, SignalType=\\\"Purview DLP alert\\\", AttackSeverity=case(Severity =~ \\\"Critical\\\", \\\"🔴 CRITICAL\\\", Severity =~ \\\"High\\\", \\\"🟠 HIGH\\\", Severity =~ \\\"Medium\\\", \\\"🟡 MEDIUM\\\", Severity =~ \\\"Low\\\", \\\"🔵 LOW\\\", \\\"⚪ INFORMATIONAL / UNKNOWN\\\"), SeverityRank=case(Severity =~ \\\"Critical\\\", 1, Severity =~ \\\"High\\\", 2, Severity =~ \\\"Medium\\\", 3, Severity =~ \\\"Low\\\", 4, 5), AgentLinkClue=case(DirectAI == 1, \\\"DIRECT AI / COPILOT CONTEXT\\\", UserCorrelated == 1, \\\"SAME USER HAS AGENT ACTIVITY\\\", \\\"NO AGENT LINK FOUND\\\"), EvidenceClassification=case(DirectAI == 1, \\\"CONFIRMED PRODUCT ALERT - DIRECT AI CONTEXT\\\", UserCorrelated == 1, \\\"CORRELATED PRODUCT ALERT - AGENT USER\\\", \\\"PURVIEW DLP ALERT - NO AGENT ATTRIBUTION\\\"), SignalId=AlertId, Timestamp=AlertTimestamp;\\nlet DlpBehaviors=BehaviorInfo\\n| where Timestamp > ago(30d)\\n| where ServiceSource has \\\"Data Loss Prevention\\\" or DetectionSource has \\\"Data Loss Prevention\\\"\\n| project BehaviorTimestamp=Timestamp, BehaviorId, Title, Description, Categories, ActionType, InfoAccountUpn=AccountUpn, InfoAccountObjectId=AccountObjectId, ServiceSource, DetectionSource, AttackTechniques\\n| join kind=leftouter (BehaviorEntities | where Timestamp > ago(30d) | project BehaviorId, AccountUpn, AccountObjectId, AccountName, EntityType, EntityRole, FileName, Application, AdditionalFields) on BehaviorId\\n| extend AccountKey=tolower(coalesce(AccountUpn, AccountObjectId, InfoAccountUpn, InfoAccountObjectId, AccountName)), DirectAI=tolower(strcat(Title, \\\" \\\", Description, \\\" \\\", Categories, \\\" \\\", ActionType, \\\" \\\", Application, \\\" \\\", AdditionalFields)) has_any (\\\"copilot\\\", \\\"agent\\\", \\\"genai\\\", \\\"generative ai\\\", \\\"llm\\\")\\n| join kind=leftouter AgentActivity on AccountKey\\n| summarize DirectAI=max(toint(DirectAI)), UserCorrelated=max(toint(AgentActivities > 0)), Accounts=make_set_if(coalesce(AccountUpn, InfoAccountUpn), isnotempty(coalesce(AccountUpn, InfoAccountUpn)), 20), AgentApplications=make_set_if(tostring(AgentApplications), AgentActivities > 0, 20), AgentActivities=max(coalesce(AgentActivities, 0)), LastAgentActivity=max(LastAgentActivity), Files=make_set_if(FileName, isnotempty(FileName), 20), EntityTypes=make_set_if(EntityType, isnotempty(EntityType), 10), EvidenceRoles=make_set_if(EntityRole, isnotempty(EntityRole), 10) by BehaviorTimestamp, BehaviorId, Title, Categories, ActionType, ServiceSource, DetectionSource, AttackTechniques\\n| extend SignalType=\\\"Purview DLP behavior\\\", AttackSeverity=\\\"⚪ NOT SCORED\\\", SeverityRank=6, AgentLinkClue=case(DirectAI == 1, \\\"DIRECT AI / COPILOT CONTEXT\\\", UserCorrelated == 1, \\\"SAME USER HAS AGENT ACTIVITY\\\", \\\"NO AGENT LINK FOUND\\\"), EvidenceClassification=case(DirectAI == 1, \\\"CONFIRMED PRODUCT BEHAVIOR - DIRECT AI CONTEXT\\\", UserCorrelated == 1, \\\"CORRELATED PRODUCT BEHAVIOR - AGENT USER\\\", \\\"PURVIEW DLP BEHAVIOR - NO AGENT ATTRIBUTION\\\"), SignalId=BehaviorId, Timestamp=BehaviorTimestamp, Category=Categories;\\nunion DlpAlerts, DlpBehaviors\\n  | summarize Value=dcount(SignalId) by SignalType, AttackSeverity, AgentLinkClue, SeverityRank\\n  | extend Metric=strcat(SignalType, \\\" · \\\", AttackSeverity, \\\" · \\\", AgentLinkClue)\\n| project SeverityRank, Metric, Value\\n| order by SeverityRank asc, Metric asc\",\"selectedWorkspaceIds\":[\"{AdvancedHuntingWorkspaceId}\"]}",
              "size": 3,
