          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### AI attack coverage, platform parity, controls, and verdicts\n\nThe 30-risk model maps evidence across Foundry, Copilot Studio, Microsoft 365 Copilot, APIM, Defender, and Sentinel. Coverage is not control effectiveness, and runtime verdicts do not replace product alert severity."
            },
            "name": "tm-coverage-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "datatable(Order:int, RiskId:string, ThreatDomain:string, Risk:string, Examples:string, DominantConsequence:string, OWASP:string, MITREAtlas:string, Coverage:string, WorkbookEvidence:string, DetectionEvidence:string, Limitation:string)\n[\n  1, \"R1\", \"Input & Prompt\", \"Prompt Injection\", \"Direct instruction override and prompt manipulation\", \"Behavior manipulation\", \"LLM01\", \"AML.T0051\", \"COVERED\", \"apim-request-injection; fo-inj; st-inj\", \"APIMPromptInjectionAllowed; FoundryPromptInjectionPatterns; CopilotStudioPromptInjectionPatterns\", \"Heuristic body matches require analyst validation\",\n  2, \"R2\", \"Input & Prompt\", \"Indirect Prompt Injection\", \"Malicious instructions in documents, email, web, RAG, or tool output\", \"Behavior manipulation\", \"LLM01\", \"AML.T0051\", \"COVERED\", \"cp-xpia; fo-guard; ah-ps\", \"FoundryGuardrailJailbreakDetected; CopilotStudioIndirectPromptInjectionInResponse; CopilotIndirectPromptInjection\", \"Coverage depends on XPIA/guardrail metadata or recorded content\",\n  3, \"R3\", \"Input & Prompt\", \"Jailbreaking\", \"Attempts to evade model or system restrictions\", \"Behavior manipulation\", \"LLM01\", \"AML.T0054\", \"COVERED\", \"cp-jb; fo-guard; ah-ps\", \"FoundryGuardrailJailbreakDetected; CopilotStudioJailbreakOrModelProbing\", \"A detection flag does not prove successful bypass\",\n  4, \"R4\", \"Confidentiality\", \"Sensitive Information Disclosure\", \"Secrets, credentials, PII, or regulated data in input/output\", \"Data loss\", \"LLM02\", \"AML.T0048\", \"COVERED\", \"apim-request-sensitive; st-sens; dl-sensitive\", \"APIMSensitiveDataInRequestBody; FoundrySensitiveDataInOutput; CopilotStudioSensitiveDataInResponse\", \"Regex patterns can produce false positives and require content recording\",\n  5, \"R5\", \"Confidentiality\", \"Data Exfiltration\", \"Bulk retrieval or transfer to an external destination\", \"Data loss\", \"LLM02\", \"AML.T0025 / AML.T0024\", \"OBSERVABLE\", \"apim-api-enumeration; apim-operation-combination; fo-mcp-external; st-mcp-external; dl-sensitive\", \"APIMApiEnumeration; AgentExternalExfiltration; FoundryBulkDataExfiltrationIntent; CopilotStudioBulkDataExfiltrationIntent\", \"Breadth, intent, or egress evidence does not always prove data transfer\",\n  6, \"R6\", \"Model Exploitation\", \"Training Data Extraction\", \"Attempts to reproduce or extract training examples\", \"Data loss or model disclosure\", \"LLM02\", \"AML.T0024\", \"PARTIAL\", \"tm-extraction-inversion\", \"Heuristic hunt only; no scheduled detection\", \"Captured request patterns identify extraction attempts, not memorized training-data disclosure\",\n  7, \"R7\", \"Model Exploitation\", \"Model Inversion\", \"Inference of sensitive training attributes from model behavior\", \"Data loss or model disclosure\", \"LLM02\", \"AML.T0024\", \"PARTIAL\", \"tm-extraction-inversion\", \"Heuristic hunt only; no scheduled detection\", \"Membership and attribute-inference probing is observable; successful inversion requires reference truth or model-internal evidence\",\n  8, \"R8\", \"Supply Chain\", \"Supply Chain Attack\", \"Compromised model, connector, MCP server, dependency, or package\", \"Structural compromise\", \"LLM03\", \"AML.T0010\", \"OBSERVABLE\", \"ah-mcp; fo-mcp-inventory; oa-audit\", \"FoundryMcpToolDescriptionChange; FoundryNewToolFirstSeen; CopilotStudioNewConnectorFirstSeen; CopilotPluginLifecycleAnomaly\", \"Requires provenance, signing, vulnerability, and change-management context\",\n  9, \"R9\", \"Supply Chain\", \"Tool / Plugin Poisoning\", \"Malicious tool description, result, schema, or cross-server instruction\", \"Action or lateral movement\", \"LLM03\", \"AML.T0053\", \"COVERED\", \"fo-mcp-command-tools; st-mcp-command-tools; ah-vscode-mcp-risk\", \"FoundryMcpCrossServerOverride; FoundryMcpToolDescriptionChange; CopilotStudioMcpCommandExecutionTool\", \"Tool metadata can be absent or change across SDK versions\",\n  10, \"R10\", \"Model Exploitation\", \"Model Poisoning\", \"Unauthorized or malicious model replacement or behavior change\", \"Persistent model compromise\", \"LLM04\", \"AML.T0020\", \"PARTIAL\", \"fo-agents; mo-grid\", \"FoundryNewModelFirstSeen; CopilotStudioNewModelFirstSeen; CopilotSystemPromptOverride\", \"First-seen or configuration drift detects model change, not poisoned weights\",\n  11, \"R11\", \"Data & Knowledge\", \"Data Poisoning\", \"Manipulated knowledge or input data\", \"Persistent contamination\", \"LLM04\", \"AML.T0020\", \"PARTIAL\", \"cp-rag; dl-drift; gv-ext\", \"RagSourcePoisoningWrites; FoundrySessionContextContamination\", \"No direct data-integrity or lineage proof for every source\",\n  12, \"R12\", \"Data & Knowledge\", \"RAG Poisoning\", \"Malicious content in retrieval and grounding sources\", \"Persistent contamination\", \"LLM04 / LLM08\", \"AML.T0020\", \"OBSERVABLE\", \"cp-rag; fo-mcp-external; dl-content\", \"FoundryUntrustedToolSource; RagSourcePoisoningWrites; FoundryAgentMemoryPoisoning\", \"Often inferred from source and context behavior rather than document truth\",\n  13, \"R13\", \"Data & Knowledge\", \"Vector Database Poisoning\", \"Manipulated embeddings, index entries, or nearest-neighbor results\", \"Persistent contamination\", \"LLM08\", \"AML.T0020\", \"CONDITIONAL\", \"Evidence contract only; no live panel\", \"Azure AI Search Indexing.Index audit required\", \"Requires Search diagnostic logs plus content integrity, provenance, and caller attribution\",\n  14, \"R14\", \"Runtime\", \"Insecure Output Handling\", \"Unsafe HTML, Markdown, scripts, commands, or active content consumed downstream\", \"Operational compromise\", \"LLM05\", \"AML.T0050\", \"OBSERVABLE\", \"apim-unsafe-active-output; apim-verdict; st-sens; dl-content\", \"APIMUnsafeActiveContentResponse; FoundryUnsafeActiveContentInOutput; CopilotStudioUnsafeActiveContentInResponse; CopilotUnsafeActiveContentInResponse\", \"Output visibility does not show whether a downstream renderer executed it\",\n  15, \"R15\", \"Tools & APIs\", \"SSRF\", \"Agent or tool reaches internal, metadata, loopback, or unapproved endpoints\", \"Action or lateral movement\", \"LLM05 / LLM06\", \"AML.T0049\", \"OBSERVABLE\", \"fo-mcp-external; tm-verdict-events; st-mcp-external; apim-recon\", \"FoundryInternalNetworkTargetToolCall; CopilotStudioInternalNetworkTargetCall\", \"A successful URL-bearing tool span does not prove that the target returned data; M365 lacks target telemetry\",\n  16, \"R16\", \"Runtime\", \"Sandbox Escape\", \"Agent or tool escapes container, VM, browser, or execution boundary\", \"Operational compromise\", \"LLM05\", \"AML.T0011\", \"PARTIAL\", \"ah-vscode-mcp-processes; ah-vscode-mcp-risk\", \"VSCodeMcpCommandCapableProcess\", \"Endpoint process evidence does not cover every cloud sandbox or prove escape\",\n  17, \"R17\", \"Agent Decision\", \"Excessive Agency\", \"Autonomous action beyond intended scope or approval\", \"Privilege abuse\", \"LLM06\", \"AML.T0047 / AML.T0050\", \"COVERED\", \"apim-volume-anomaly; apim-new-operation; apim-operation-combination; fo-tools; dl-nohuman\", \"APIMAbnormalRequestVolume; APIMNewOperationFirstSeen; FoundryExcessiveToolChaining; CopilotStudioExcessiveToolAgency; CopilotTraceLevelAnomaly\", \"Gateway activity shows behavioral drift but not whether agent authorization was appropriate\",\n  18, \"R18\", \"Tools & APIs\", \"Unauthorized Tool Invocation\", \"Unapproved server, tool, connector, or operation is invoked\", \"Action or lateral movement\", \"LLM06\", \"AML.T0040\", \"COVERED\", \"apim-command-tools; fo-mcp-allowlist; st-mcp-allowlist; ah-vscode-mcp-calls\", \"FoundryMcpUnapprovedServerExecution; CopilotStudioUntrustedMcpTarget; APIMCommandCapableToolDefinition\", \"APIM shows dangerous capability exposure but not invocation unless agent spans are correlated\",\n  19, \"R19\", \"Tools & APIs\", \"Function Call Manipulation\", \"Manipulated tool name, arguments, schema, routing, or result\", \"Action or lateral movement\", \"LLM06\", \"AML.T0053\", \"COVERED\", \"fo-mcp-exploit-chain; st-mcp-exploit-intent; apim-body-events\", \"FoundryMcpExploitIntentExecutionChain; CopilotStudioMcpExploitExecutionChain\", \"Content recording is required for argument/intent evidence\",\n  20, \"R20\", \"Agent Decision\", \"Confused Deputy\", \"Agent misuses its identity or permissions on behalf of a lower-privileged actor\", \"Privilege abuse\", \"LLM06\", \"AML.T0047\", \"PARTIAL\", \"apim-new-operation; apim-new-country; apim-request-dependency; fo-mcp-trace-chain; dl-lateral\", \"APIMNewOperationFirstSeen; APIMNewCountryForKnownCaller; FoundryInterAgentPermissionMismatch; CopilotStudioInterAgentPermissionMismatch\", \"APIM detects identity behavior drift but not effective delegated authorization; M365 lacks inter-agent authorization telemetry\",\n  21, \"R21\", \"Confidentiality\", \"Context Leakage\", \"Conversation, tenant, session, memory, or retrieved context crosses boundaries\", \"Data loss\", \"LLM07\", \"AML.T0056\", \"PARTIAL\", \"dl-content; iv-feed; fo-mcp-trace-chain\", \"FoundrySessionContextContamination; CopilotStudioSessionContextContamination\", \"Requires stable tenant/session identifiers and content access\",\n  22, \"R22\", \"Confidentiality\", \"System Prompt Leakage\", \"System/developer instructions or tool architecture are disclosed\", \"Data loss\", \"LLM07\", \"AML.T0056\", \"COVERED\", \"apim-system-prompt-disclosure; apim-verdict; fo-inj; tl-feed\", \"APIMSystemPromptDisclosure; FoundrySystemPromptDisclosure; CopilotStudioSystemPromptDisclosure; CopilotSystemPromptDisclosure\", \"Full prompt visibility is sensitive and opt-in\",\n  23, \"R23\", \"Model Exploitation\", \"Hallucination\", \"Unsupported or factually incorrect output\", \"Wrong decision\", \"LLM09\", \"AML.T0015\", \"CONDITIONAL\", \"Evidence contract only; no live panel\", \"Foundry Groundedness / Groundedness Pro evaluation required\", \"Continuous evaluation can score sampled outputs; evaluator failure is evidence of ungroundedness, not universal factual truth\",\n  24, \"R24\", \"Model Exploitation\", \"Adversarial Hallucination\", \"Attacker intentionally induces false but plausible output\", \"Wrong decision\", \"LLM09\", \"AML.T0015\", \"CONDITIONAL\", \"Evidence contract only; no live panel\", \"Foundry red-team scan and evaluation output required\", \"Attack-success and groundedness results are test evidence; production causation still requires trace correlation\",\n  25, \"R25\", \"Runtime\", \"Agent Looping\", \"Repeated tool/model calls or non-terminating workflow\", \"Operational or economic impact\", \"LLM10\", \"AML.T0050\", \"COVERED\", \"apim-volume-anomaly; apim-high-failure; apim-request-dependency; fo-tokens; fo-time\", \"APIMAbnormalRequestVolume; APIMHighFailureRate; FoundryExcessiveToolChaining; CopilotStudioExcessiveToolAgency; CopilotTraceLevelAnomaly\", \"APIM request patterns can indicate loops but agent/tool spans provide stronger proof\",\n  26, \"R26\", \"Runtime\", \"Cost Amplification Attack\", \"Token, tool, retrieval, or model-call amplification\", \"Economic impact\", \"LLM10\", \"AML.T0029 / AML.T0034\", \"COVERED\", \"apim-volume-anomaly; apim-tokens; fo-tokens; mo-cost\", \"APIMAbnormalRequestVolume; FoundryTokenCostSpike; OpenAITokenCostSpike; AgentCostAnomalyByDimension\", \"Missing or streaming token usage can undercount cost; request volume is only a cost proxy\",\n  27, \"R27\", \"Runtime\", \"Denial of Service\", \"Flooding, quota exhaustion, timeouts, or resource starvation\", \"Availability impact\", \"LLM10\", \"AML.T0029\", \"COVERED\", \"apim-availability-pressure; apim-high-failure; apim-latency-anomaly; apim-api-enumeration; st-err\", \"APIMAvailabilityPressure; APIMHighFailureRate; APIMApiEnumeration; FoundryToolErrorStorm; CopilotStudioConnectorErrorStorm; CopilotRedTeamPacingAnomaly\", \"Errors, latency, and 429s can be working controls or operational faults rather than attacks\",\n  28, \"R28\", \"Memory & State\", \"Memory Poisoning\", \"Malicious content written to or recalled from persistent memory\", \"Persistence between interactions\", \"LLM04 / LLM07\", \"AML.T0018\", \"COVERED\", \"dl-content; dl-drift\", \"FoundryAgentMemoryPoisoning; AgentMemoryOperations\", \"Memory semantic conventions are evolving and may be absent\",\n  29, \"R29\", \"Memory & State\", \"State Manipulation\", \"Session, workflow, identity, or authorization state is altered\", \"Persistence or privilege abuse\", \"LLM04 / LLM06\", \"AML.T0018\", \"PARTIAL\", \"iv-feed; dl-lateral; ah-risk\", \"FoundrySessionContextContamination; CopilotStudioSessionContextContamination\", \"No universal state-change schema across platforms\",\n  30, \"R30\", \"Supply Chain\", \"AI Package Hallucination\", \"Model recommends a nonexistent or attacker-controlled package\", \"Structural compromise\", \"LLM03\", \"AML.T0010\", \"CONDITIONAL\", \"Evidence contract only; no live panel\", \"Defender package execution plus registry/SBOM validation required\", \"Install commands are endpoint evidence only; proving hallucination requires correlation to model output and authoritative package provenance\"\n]\n| summarize Value = count() by Coverage\n| extend Order = case(Coverage == \"COVERED\", 1, Coverage == \"OBSERVABLE\", 2, Coverage == \"PARTIAL\", 3, Coverage == \"CONDITIONAL\", 4, 5), Metric = Coverage\n| project Order, Metric, Value\n| order by Order asc",
              "size": 3,
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "title": "Coverage status across 30 AI risks",
              "tileSettings": {
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "blue"
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true,
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                }
