ther a downstream renderer executed it\",\n  15, \"R15\", \"Tools & APIs\", \"SSRF\", \"Agent or tool reaches internal, metadata, loopback, or unapproved endpoints\", \"Action or lateral movement\", \"LLM05 / LLM06\", \"AML.T0049\", \"OBSERVABLE\", \"fo-mcp-external; tm-verdict-events; st-mcp-external; apim-recon\", \"FoundryInternalNetworkTargetToolCall; CopilotStudioInternalNetworkTargetCall\", \"A successful URL-bearing tool span does not prove that the target returned data; M365 lacks target telemetry\",\n  16, \"R16\", \"Runtime\", \"Sandbox Escape\", \"Agent or tool escapes container, VM, browser, or execution boundary\", \"Operational compromise\", \"LLM05\", \"AML.T0011\", \"PARTIAL\", \"ah-vscode-mcp-processes; ah-vscode-mcp-risk\", \"VSCodeMcpCommandCapableProcess\", \"Endpoint process evidence does not cover every cloud sandbox or prove escape\",\n  17, \"R17\", \"Agent Decision\", \"Excessive Agency\", \"Autonomous action beyond intended scope or approval\", \"Privilege abuse\", \"LLM06\", \"AML.T0047 / AML.T0050\", \"COVERED\", \"apim-volume-anomaly; apim-new-operation; apim-operation-combination; fo-tools; dl-nohuman\", \"APIMAbnormalRequestVolume; APIMNewOperationFirstSeen; FoundryExcessiveToolChaining; CopilotStudioExcessiveToolAgency; CopilotTraceLevelAnomaly\", \"Gateway activity shows behavioral drift but not whether agent authorization was appropriate\",\n  18, \"R18\", \"Tools & APIs\", \"Unauthorized Tool Invocation\", \"Unapproved server, tool, connector, or operation is invoked\", \"Action or lateral movement\", \"LLM06\", \"AML.T0040\", \"COVERED\", \"apim-command-tools; fo-mcp-allowlist; st-mcp-allowlist; ah-vscode-mcp-calls\", \"FoundryMcpUnapprovedServerExecution; CopilotStudioUntrustedMcpTarget; APIMCommandCapableToolDefinition\", \"APIM shows dangerous capability exposure but not invocation unless agent spans are correlated\",\n  19, \"R19\", \"Tools & APIs\", \"Function Call Manipulation\", \"Manipulated tool name, arguments, schema, r